        ('A5 note, 2026-10-17, E22/E22v', 'Interchange interventions: per-unit effective IIA 0.19–0.88; above a swap-free predictor at z (+0.15 [0.07, 0.23]), not at S, h4, h5. A5 confidence 0.5 → 0.45.'),
