          'P34: P32v rerun on fresh rows after excluding the failed GPU node k8s-haosu-22 in part_job.sh (neutral-flag control e2n, e↔μ swap, c2h1 (b2h1) alone); a literal lepton circuit with MLPs and embeddings also ablated, class-balanced accuracy and 10-class confusion vs random sets; which particle-block heads carry the flag (C15).',
          'P35: which stage of the pair route (pair-embedding MLP, softmax, head output) makes the nonlinear close-pair response; whether that term changes calls on natural jets; float32 effect on ParT_kin per class (C16, C14, C1).',
          'P29: Sophon\'s differences one at a time on ParT_kin: pT-normalised four-vectors, mass-decorrelation reweighting; R, probe-free R_h, route split (C13, C3s).',
          'P30 (neighbour-holding part taken up by P33, round C7: C16): per-particle moves that hold distances to the nearest neighbours; rank-window and threshold forms on the smooth ParT per-particle route; ParticleNet EdgeConv neighbour-difference split (C14, A8).',
          'P24: prong edits that also hold the hard-particle (z ≥ 0.02) or soft-drop mass, mass-filtered rotation arms, DAS with rotation-arm DiD (C11, C4).',
