          'P12: nonlinear or per-particle forms of the axis-moment quantity; why the direction weights a pT rescaling 0.71 as much as a φ shift; which particles and value directions the block-1 class heads read (C7, C2b).',
          'C8: coarser units (whole blocks) and other corruptions for the circuit-size curve; learned features done 2026-10-20 (P13: 50 features 51 % W/Z). Open: trained-mask selection over features, joint feature + head circuits, multi-feature or DAS-direction steering for m_A.',
          'P16: arm analysis of the planted-label ParTs (done 2026-10-20, round C4: R_a 0.185, R_b 0.215, released 0.79 / 0.72; C10 v2).',
          'P17: weight-shuffled and fresh-init controls and the φ − 0.06 mirror-sign test for ParT\'s C7 direction; which per-jet quantity besides m_A carries the remaining 6/7 of the φ logit change (C7). (Round C5, P23/P23v: the φ shift acts through the mirror-symmetric M2-like term per jet, not an odd centroid term; the gap remains.)',
