          'H31 (D6, D11, D13): smoke only; full run done as H32 (2026-10-20, H32, H32v; new D15). H37: a control that reaches the edit\'s full τ32 change at fixed |cos θ*| and pair masses (non-rigid edits inside prongs, or reweighting-matched natural jets); larger matched subset; redraw h32_dalitz.png with MLP5 and b_cos per direction.',
          'H35 (D14, D2): done 2026-10-20 (H35, b-prong attribution refuted by H35v; new D14). H38: cause of the within-prong response (C1 −2.6: pT rank, σd0–pT consistency, angle); separate b from W → cs charm with hadron-truth or secondary-vertex labels; Sref ratio with matched edits.',
          'H36 (D4, D4m): done 2026-10-20 (H36, H36v). H39: architecture-matched nulls (EFN, PFN, PN) and second training seeds for the axis-direction test; published working points; figure with a null band.',
